    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Land it Rocket</strong> is a challenging yet accessible 2D rocket-landing game inspired by classic lunar landers.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Test your skills across <strong>28 carefully crafted levels</strong>, navigating narrow passages, avoiding hazards, and perfecting your landing technique.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you're chasing high scores or just want to relax and land safely, there's a mode for you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- \ud83d\ude80 28 handcrafted levels with increasing difficulty  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- \ud83c\udf0c Endless Mode for unlimited challenge  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- \ud83c\udfae Full controller support \u2013 plug and play  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- \u2728 Simple controls, clean visuals, smooth performance  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Perfect for fans of physics-based platformers, retro challenges, and relaxing gameplay loops.</p>",
